Discover modern, low-maintenance living in the thriving community of South Ripley. Perfectly suited for first-home buyers, investors, and growing families, this brand-new single-storey home combines practical design, quality finishes, and everyday comfort.



Designed with affordability and functionality in mind, the home offers a bright open-plan layout featuring a contemporary kitchen, spacious living and dining area, comfortable bedrooms, modern bathrooms, and a secure single-car garage. Neutral colour palettes and abundant natural light create a welcoming atmosphere throughout, while the easy-care landscaping ensures more time enjoying your home and less time maintaining it.



Located within one of South East Queensland's fastest-growing residential communities, this home presents an outstanding opportunity to secure a quality property in a highly sought-after location.



Key Features



* Brand new single-storey home

* Modern brick veneer construction

* 3 generous bedrooms

* Master bedroom with built-in robe

* 2 stylish bathrooms

* Open-plan living and dining area

* Modern kitchen with quality appliances

* Single lock-up garage with internal access

* Fully fenced backyard

* Low-maintenance landscaping

* Energy-efficient design



Other Features



* LED downlights throughout

* Durable flooring to living areas

* Quality carpet to bedrooms

* Roller blinds throughout

* Modern colour scheme

* NBN-ready connectivity

* Smoke alarms installed

* Water-efficient fixtures

* Security screens (where applicable)

* Ample storage solutions



Home Design



This thoughtfully designed home maximises space and functionality within a compact footprint. The open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area forms the heart of the home, providing a seamless environment for everyday living and entertaining. The master bedroom is privately positioned and complemented by a built-in robe and ensuite, while the additional bedrooms are serviced by a contemporary family bathroom.



The practical floorplan offers excellent flow between indoor and outdoor spaces, making it ideal for modern Australian lifestyles.



Home Inclusions



* Modern kitchen with laminate benchtops

* White cabinetry and tiled splashback

* Stainless steel appliances

* Walk-in shower to bathrooms

* Contemporary vanities and tapware

* Built-in wardrobes

* Quality floor coverings throughout

* Colorbond roof

* Concrete driveway

* Turf and basic landscaping package

* Fencing package included

* Letterbox and clothesline

* Flyscreens to windows



Location Highlights



* Approximately 10 minutes to Ripley Town Centre

* Approximately 15 minutes to Orion Springfield Central

* Easy access to the Centenary Highway

* Close to local schools and childcare centres

* Nearby parks, playgrounds, and sporting facilities

* Convenient access to public transport

* Surrounded by walking and cycling pathways

* Close to future shopping and community infrastructure

* Approximately 40 minutes to Brisbane CBD

* Approximately 60 minutes to the Gold Coast



Why You'll Love South Ripley QLD 4306



South Ripley is one of South East Queensland's most exciting and rapidly growing master-planned communities. Known for its family-friendly atmosphere, modern infrastructure, and strong growth potential, the suburb offers the perfect balance of lifestyle and convenience.



Residents enjoy access to quality schools, parks, sporting facilities, shopping centres, and public transport, all while being surrounded by beautiful green spaces. With significant ongoing investment in the area and strong population growth, South Ripley continues to attract homeowners and investors seeking long-term value and an exceptional quality of life.



Whether you're purchasing your first home, upgrading your lifestyle, or expanding your investment portfolio, South Ripley offers a fantastic opportunity to be part of a vibrant and growing community.



